        "original_id": "fd5a484e-3ec4-581c-95c8-c685d06ad168",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hussein Ishaish, Tony Yoka\n- Places: Jordan, France\n- Events: 2015 AIBA World Boxing Championships, 2016 Summer Olympics\n- Roles: Boxer, professional boxer, amateur boxer\n\nFacts:\n- Tony Yoka was born on 28 April 1992 and is a French professional boxer.\n- Hussein Ishaish was born on 6 August 1995 and is a Jordanian boxer.\n- Tony Yoka represented France at the 2015 AIBA World Boxing Championships and won gold.\n- Hussein Ishaish competed for Jordan in the men's super heavyweight event at the 2016 Summer Olympics.\n- Tony Yoka represented France at the 2016 Summer Olympics and won the gold medal in the super-heavyweight division as an amateur.\n- Hussein Ishaish was defeated in the 2016 Olympic quarterfinals by Tony Yoka, who went on to win gold.",
